<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land shares suspended, deal rumours.</title>
<headline>DBS Land shares suspended, deal rumours.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in property group DBS Land Ltd were suspended on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The daily Straits Times newspaper said the move might be linked to the suspension of trading on Monday in the shares of Malaysia's Hospital Pantai.</p>
<p>The newspaper quoted market speculation that DBS Land may be about to buy Hosiptal Pantai's 19 percent stake in Singapore listed health group Parkway Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>None of the companies was available for immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
